---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ateliers IA | Biscuits IA"
  description="Découvrez nos ateliers IA pour apprendre à utiliser l'intelligence artificielle dans vos projets associatifs ou TPE/PME."
>
  <section class="hero-workshops">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Formation Pratique</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Apprenez à utiliser l'IA pour vos projets, avec des ateliers accessibles à tous, adaptés à votre niveau.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="workshops-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Nos Ateliers</h2>
        <p>Des formations progressives pour maîtriser l'IA à votre rythme</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="workshops-grid">
        <article class="workshop-card level-beginner">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div class="level-badge">
              <span class="level-dot"></span>
              Débutant
            </div>
            <div class="duration">2h</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-icon">
            <span class="icon-wrapper">📥</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Découverte IA</h3>
            <p>Introduction aux outils IA et bonnes pratiques responsables pour démarrer en toute confiance.</p>
            
            <ul class="features-list">
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Comprendre les fondamentaux
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Premiers pas avec ChatGPT
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Éthique et IA responsable
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="price">Gratuit</div>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-workshop">S'inscrire</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="workshop-card level-intermediate featured">
          <div class="featured-badge">⭐ Populaire</div>
          <div class="card-header">
            <div class="level-badge">
              <span class="level-dot"></span>
              Intermédiaire
            </div>
            <div class="duration">4h</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-icon">
            <span class="icon-wrapper">🧠</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Atelier Avancé IA</h3>
            <p>Création d'assistants IA personnalisés et workflows automatisés pour optimiser votre organisation.</p>
            
            <ul class="features-list">
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Créer un assistant personnalisé
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Automatiser vos tâches
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Prompt engineering avancé
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="price">
              20€<span class="price-note">participation libre suggérée</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-workshop">S'inscrire</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="workshop-card level-advanced">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div class="level-badge">
              <span class="level-dot"></span>
              Collaboratif
            </div>
            <div class="duration">Variable</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-icon">
            <span class="icon-wrapper">🌱</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card-content">
            <h3>Session Open-Source</h3>
            <p>Travail collaboratif sur des projets IA concrets pour associations et TPE/PME, contribution à la communauté.</p>
            
            <ul class="features-list">
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Projets réels
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Accompagnement personnalisé
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                  <path d="M16.6667 5L7.50004 14.1667L3.33337 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Réseau de contributeurs
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="price">Gratuit</div>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-workshop">Rejoindre</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="benefits-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Pourquoi nos ateliers ?</h2>
      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">💡</div>
          <h3>Pratique avant tout</h3>
          <p>Des exercices concrets adaptés à vos besoins réels</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">👥</div>
          <h3>En petit groupe</h3>
          <p>15 participants max pour un accompagnement personnalisé</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">🎯</div>
          <h3>Sans prérequis</h3>
          <p>Accessible à tous, quel que soit votre niveau technique</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>Suivi post-atelier</h3>
          <p>Ressources et support pour continuer après la formation</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-modern">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Inscrivez-vous à un atelier</h2>
        <p>Découvrez et expérimentez l'IA pour améliorer vos projets dès aujourd'hui.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">
            S'inscrire maintenant
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
              <path d="M7.5 15L12.5 10L7.5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/devis" class="btn-secondary">Poser une question</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-workshops {
    padding: 120px 0 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-workshops::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='80' height='80' viewBox='0 0 80 80' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Cpath d='M0 0h40v40H0V0zm40 40h40v40H40V40z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .gradient-text {
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.95;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .workshops-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .section-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .workshops-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .workshop-card {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 32px;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .workshop-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .featured {
    border-color:oklch(29.737% 0.04196 42.503);
  }

  .featured-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    right: 24px;
    background: oklch(29.737% 0.04196 42.503);
    color: var(--color-gray-900);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(251, 202, 147, 0.4);
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .level-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: var(--color-accent-honey);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .level-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #4caf50;
  }

  .level-intermediate .level-dot {
    background: #ff9800;
  }

  .level-advanced .level-dot {
    background: #2196f3;
  }

  .duration {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #999;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 36px;
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .level-intermediate .icon-wrapper {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .level-advanced .icon-wrapper {
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .card-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .card-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .features-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .features-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555;
  }

  .features-list svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    stroke: #4caf50;
  }

  .card-footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .price-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #999;
  }

  .btn-workshop {
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(234, 166, 102, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-workshop:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .benefits-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .benefits-section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .benefit-item {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .benefit-icon {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 40px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(251, 197, 147, 0.3);
  }

  .benefit-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .benefit-item p {
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-modern {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
  }

  .cta-content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cta-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(251, 202, 147, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(251, 194, 147, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-workshops {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
    }

    .workshops-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .workshops-section, .benefits-section, .cta-modern {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>